        "9599ce6b-d23d-4e5e-a5e7-ec9c0974fb26": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are a positive, colorful, and unabashedly authentic place where everyone is ALWAYS encouraged to be themselves! From our accessories to our crafts, our hope is to unleash self-expression, exploration, and play—allowing the super side of every kid to shine.</p><p>We believe it is important to stay educated on social issues, share resources, and give back. We support causes and organizations that align with our values of building a kind, inclusive, and joyful future for kids everywhere.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
